  "description": "Beom-yeong, a man as tall and expressionless as a giant, reached out as a guardian to Mun Jeong-in, who had lost his parents and was locked in his own world. Although he is not used to children, he uses his natural patience to help Jeong-in open up and provides generous support so that he can live like other ordinary children. However, Jeong-in is the only one who does not know that the only time he can be free is in the environment, which is strictly controlled by Jang Beom-yeong...\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/2183000230), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/yomi0064), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=10111366), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/detail.asp?series_num=917005504)\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/sunset_in_water)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/sunset_in_water), [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/sunset_in_W)",
